    "description": "Koleksi Postman untuk pengujian Materi Week 10 Pemrograman Web: From CRUD to Application Flow.\nMencakup:\n01. GET /api/products (List)\n02. POST /api/products (Create with 201 Created)\n03. POST /api/products (Validation Error with 422 Unprocessable)\n04. GET /api/products/1 (Detail with 200 OK)\n05. GET /api/products/9999 (Not Found with 404)\n06. PUT /api/products/1 (Update with 200 OK)\n07. DELETE /api/products/1 (Delete with 200 OK)",
